1
00:00:00,656 --> 00:00:03,608
SafeDeal: milestone escrow for freelance work,

2
00:00:03,628 --> 00:00:05,396
paid in USDC on Arc.

3
00:00:06,041 --> 00:00:08,591
This is a real deal on Arc mainnet:

4
00:00:08,611 --> 00:00:10,289
funded in one transaction,

5
00:00:10,309 --> 00:00:12,066
paid out three different ways.

6
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:15,563
Open source, verified on Sourcify.

7
00:00:16,731 --> 00:00:19,034
Here is the full flow on a local devnet,

8
00:00:19,054 --> 00:00:20,138
with test accounts.

9
00:00:21,194 --> 00:00:24,064
The freelancer writes the proposal and sends a link.

10
00:00:24,084 --> 00:00:25,923
No transaction, no fee.

11
00:00:27,229 --> 00:00:28,730
The client checks the terms,

12
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:33,247
and locks 500 USDC with one signature and one transaction.

13
00:00:33,267 --> 00:00:35,566
On Arc, gas is paid in USDC.

14
00:00:36,872 --> 00:00:38,373
The freelancer accepts.

15
00:00:38,393 --> 00:00:39,222
From now on,

16
00:00:39,242 --> 00:00:42,119
the client can no longer cancel the deal alone.

17
00:00:42,139 --> 00:00:44,178
The freelancer delivers, with a link.

18
00:00:46,589 --> 00:00:47,695
The client approves.

19
00:00:47,715 --> 00:00:48,426
Paid.

20
00:00:48,446 --> 00:00:49,684
Final in under a second.

21
00:00:51,078 --> 00:00:52,603
If the client stays silent,

22
00:00:52,623 --> 00:00:54,167
the review period runs out.

23
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:59,416
Then anyone can release the payment to the freelancer.

24
00:01:01,310 --> 00:01:03,940
Disputes go to the arbiter both sides chose.

25
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:08,382
The arbiter can only split the money between them,

26
00:01:08,402 --> 00:01:09,203
never take it.

27
00:01:13,410 --> 00:01:15,796
Each side can always give money to the other.

28
00:01:15,816 --> 00:01:18,178
Taking money needs consent, a timer,

29
00:01:18,198 --> 00:01:19,216
or the arbiter.

30
00:01:19,236 --> 00:01:20,875
No platform, no fees.

31
00:01:22,181 --> 00:01:23,033
SafeDeal.

32
00:01:23,053 --> 00:01:24,366
Live on Arc mainnet.

33
00:01:24,386 --> 00:01:25,506
Links in the description.
